          "id": 555391795,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "This fixed my crash. Thanks you! So it is only left vs right channel desync now on pause. D:)",
          "author": {
            "id": 4334216,
            "username": "ValZapod",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Valerii Zapod.",
            "state": "active",
